<title>USA: 3M forms Adhesives Division.</title>
<headline>3M forms Adhesives Division.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minnesota Mining &amp; Manufacturing Co said Monday it formed the Adhesives Division from its former Industrial Adhesives and Aerospace Department of the Industrial Tape and Specialties Division.</p>
<p>The new division will provide specialty adhesives to the industrial, commercial and consumer markets, as well as a line of aerospace products to aircraft builders and related businesses.</p>
<p>The company said it expects growth from new products and international expansion.</p>
<p>	  ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
